flowchart TB
    User[Public visitor / customer / staff / administrator]
    CF[Cloudflare proxy<br/>optional; Full strict when Origin CA is used]
    Nginx[nginx TLS boundary<br/>80→443 redirect · HSTS · static assets]
    App[Node.js 22 / Express / tRPC<br/>loopback 127.0.0.1:3000]
    DB[(MySQL 8<br/>loopback / private container network)]
    Files[Encrypted file storage<br/>outside web root]
    Root[Constrained root controllers<br/>backup/restore · certificate · platform update]
    External[Operator-enabled services only<br/>SMTP · Stripe · Entra/SAML · Graph · S3 · approved webhooks]

    User -->|HTTPS| CF
    User -->|HTTPS if no proxy| Nginx
    CF -->|HTTPS| Nginx
    Nginx -->|proxy_pass| App
    App -->|parameterized queries| DB
    App -->|authorized stream only| Files
    App <-->|validated Unix sockets only| Root
    App -. opt-in server egress .-> External

